# Docker builds: apps/java-api/Dockerfile and apps/notification-service/Dockerfile, both with the
# repository root as context. Send just what they copy (not node_modules, dist, target, ...).
*
!apps/java-api/.mvn
!apps/java-api/mvnw
!apps/java-api/pom.xml
!apps/java-api/src
!api-contract/openapi.yaml
!apps/notification-service/.mvn
!apps/notification-service/mvnw
!apps/notification-service/pom.xml
!apps/notification-service/src
!api-contract/notification-service/openapi.yaml
